e take control of Assassins  Jacob and Evie fry as they fight to take  the boroughs of London back from the  Templar gangs taking over there's also  Assassin's Creed 3 remastered the first  Mainline Assassin's Creed after Ezio's  Saga came to a close taking place in  18th century America AC3 introduced a  new protagonist more fluid parkour Naval  Combat and new weapons like the Rope  Dart Assassin's Creed Odyssey is a fan  favorite and if you've not played it or  are itching to play as alexios or  Cassandra once again now's your chance  as it's also coming to game catalog  Odyssey takes place in ancient Greece  during the Peloponnesian War Between  Athens and Sparta and has more of a  focus on combat than stealth as a  mercenary you fight on both sides but  also hunt down and destroy the evil Cult  of Cosmos all the Assassin's Creed  Chronicles titles are also joining the  catalog so you can join the fight  against the Templars in China India and  Russia the Chronicles games are  side-scrolling Platformers but don't  worry the core tenets of stealth combat  and parkour still play a huge role  if you're a PlayStation Plus premium  subscriber you also get access to the  classics catalog and lucky you because  Yakuza 3 4 and 5 remastered or all  joining the catalog this month if you've  watched this PS Plus update series  before or follow me on Twitter you know  how much I love the Yakuza games they're  a perfect mix of melodrama and absurdity  so consider this my plea to you to have  a go Yakuza zero kawami and kiwami 2 are  already in the game catalog so dig in to  one of the best gaming sagas around but  that's not all that's joining the roster  as there are also some PS3 games to  round out the month's offerings like  limbo which is made by the same team who  made inside it's another Moody and  Atmospheric platformer and it won't  surprise you to learn that inside is  considered a spiritual sequel to limbo  while you're getting excited for Street  Fighter 6 why not